        "title": "Penticos nung kumma he poubaumei",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Penticos nung kumma he! poubaumei,",
            "Guang lou datro mei kapumma khou;",
            "Tingsang gaimei chang 4@& man dat mak khang,",
            "Jaipat lou dat ro.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Rianra jingmei ram tigan lou diu khang,",
            "Tikei lou o nang jaujian gaimei;",
            "Pap guaina kaothan khang maichuangmei kum,",
            "Bumang than guang o.",
            "",
            "2. Theimei nganna khanga thei kanmei guai,",
            "Kandih neilamei lanimei guai;",
            "Nduang gutro tingsang gai pui ram khou,",
            "Man nimei guai ta.",
            "",
            "3. Bumang thanmei njianmei guang dat ro,",
            "Ring nithe pap khou manmei guai rui;",
            "Tingsang ring nimei chang 4@& thai maknga,",
            "Man ngam kan nithe.",
            "",
            "4. Musang lakkhe kross rukhou khang loumei,",
            "Aniu lung jingmei rui gumliamma;",
            "Timan lou o kandih neilamei guai,",
            "Nangta ning dat khang."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
